    "课堂会话测试文稿--paragraph-1": {
      "id": "课堂会话测试文稿--paragraph-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "课堂会话测试文稿--paragraph-1--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "e2e/session.spec.ts 的测试文稿。这里没有配置课堂服务；需要课堂服务的用例在头部加上 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "presmium.session.server",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "session--paragraph-1": {
      "id": "session--paragraph-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "session--paragraph-1--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "课堂会话把主讲与学习者连到同一个课堂：主讲创建课堂，学习者打开加入链接或扫描二维码进入，各自看到同一份文稿。课堂状态显示在网页导航栏的“课堂”按钮中，幻灯片形态显示在演讲者视图的 Presmium 面板中。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "session--list-1": {
      "id": "session--list-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "session--list-1--text-0",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "session--list-1--text-0-item-0",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "session--list-1--text-0-0-0",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "创建课堂",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "：主讲填写昵称后创建，得到加入链接与二维码"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "session--list-1--text-0-item-1",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "session--list-1--text-0-1-0",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "加入课堂",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "：学习者打开链接 "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "?room=<课堂>&name=<昵称>",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "，或扫码后填写昵称"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "session--list-1--text-0-item-2",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "session--list-1--text-0-2-0",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "结束课堂",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "：主讲结束后，学习者看到课堂已结束"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "session--paragraph-2": {
      "id": "session--paragraph-2",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "session--paragraph-2--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "课堂服务由 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "@lincyaw/classroom-server",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 包的命令 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "presmium-classroom-server",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 提供，地址写在文稿 frontmatter 的 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "presmium.session.server",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " 中，例如 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "ws://localhost:1234",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "。没有配置课堂服务时，文稿照常放映与阅读，课堂按钮显示“未连接”。在本仓库中这样启动课堂服务："
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "session--code-1": {
      "id": "session--code-1",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "sh",
      "value": "pnpm --filter @lincyaw/classroom-server start --port 1234"
    },
    "session-follow--paragraph-1": {
      "id": "session-follow--paragraph-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "session-follow--paragraph-1--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "跟随主讲",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "：主讲翻到哪一节、哪一步、哪个视图，学习者就到哪里"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "session-follow--paragraph-2": {
      "id": "session-follow--paragraph-2",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "session-follow--paragraph-2--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "学习者加入课堂后默认跟随主讲：主讲的章节、步骤与视图实时共享，网页形态通过宿主的导航接口移动 IR 运行时，幻灯片形态还同步 Slidev 的状态，例如圈画标注。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "session-follow--paragraph-3": {
      "id": "session-follow--paragraph-3",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "session-follow--paragraph-3--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "自主浏览",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "：学习者随时切换，自己翻阅前后内容"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "session-follow--paragraph-4": {
      "id": "session-follow--paragraph-4",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "session-follow--paragraph-4--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "想回头看前面的内容时，学习者点“自主浏览”，主讲继续翻页也不会把他拉走。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "session-follow--paragraph-5": {
      "id": "session-follow--paragraph-5",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "session-follow--paragraph-5--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "回到主讲进度",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "：一键回到主讲当前的位置，并恢复跟随"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "session-follow--paragraph-6": {
      "id": "session-follow--paragraph-6",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "session-follow--paragraph-6--text-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "点“回到主讲进度”，立即回到主讲所在的章节与步骤，之后继续跟随。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "web--paragraph-1": {
      "id": "web--paragraph-1",
